2026-04-22 19:06:17,475[utu.hooks.base_hooks] - DEBUG - base_hooks.py:41 - [toolcall-chatcmpl-tool-89053e6d6756b74e] execute_python_code({"code": "13/7", "timeout": 30}) - MainThread
2026-04-22 19:06:17,475[utu.hooks.base_hooks] - DEBUG - base_hooks.py:41 - [toolcall-chatcmpl-tool-9058118da5dfe092] execute_python_code({"code": "def check_beautiful(n, b):\n    # Convert n to base b and get its digits\n    digits = []\n    while n > 0:\n        digits.append(n % b)\n        n //= b\n    digits.reverse()\n    \n    # Check if it has exactly two digits and their sum equals sqrt(n)\n    if len(digits) == 2 and sum(digits) == int(n**0.5):\n        return True\n    return False\n\n# We need to find the smallest b such that there are more than 10 b-beautiful numbers.\nb = 2\ncount = 0\nwhile True:\n    beautiful_numbers = [i for i in range(b**2) if check_beautiful(i, b)]\n    if len(beautiful_numbers) > 10:\n        break\n    b += 1\nb", "timeout": 30}) - MainThread
2026-04-22 19:06:17,477[utu.hooks.base_hooks] - DEBUG - base_hooks.py:41 - [toolcall-chatcmpl-tool-9c7f1a4be5ec0a03] execute_python_code({"code": "from sympy import symbols, Eq, solve\na, b, c = symbols('a b c')\neq1 = Eq(a + b + c, 300)\neq2 = Eq(a**2*b + a**2*c + b**2*a + b**2*c + c**2*a + c**2*b, 6000000)\nsolutions = solve((eq1, eq2), (a, b, c))\nsolutions", "timeout": 30}) - MainThread
2026-04-22 19:06:17,478[utu.hooks.base_hooks] - DEBUG - base_hooks.py:41 - [toolcall-chatcmpl-tool-951fe6fb21ad309f] execute_python_code({"code": "from cmath import cos, sin, pi\nimport numpy as np\ndef find_remainder():\n    omega = complex(cos(2*pi/13), sin(2*pi/13))\n    product = 1\n    for k in range(13):\n        term = 2 - 2*omega**k + omega**(2*k)\n        product *= term\n    remainder = round(product.real) % 1000\n    return remainder\nremainder = find_remainder()\nremainder", "timeout": 30}) - MainThread
