2026-04-22 19:08:46,183[utu.hooks.base_hooks] - DEBUG - base_hooks.py:41 - [toolcall-chatcmpl-tool-94f29ab2349ba224] execute_python_code({"code": "import math\n\ndef is_b_beautiful(n, b):\n    sqrt_n = int(math.sqrt(n))\n    for a in range(sqrt_n + 1):\n        c = sqrt_n - a\n        if 0 <= c < b and a * b + c == n:\n            return True\n    return False\n\ndef count_b_beautiful_integers(b):\n    count = 0\n    for n in range(b, b**2):\n        if is_b_beautiful(n, b):\n            count += 1\n    return count\n\nb = 5\nwhile True:\n    count = count_b_beautiful_integers(b)\n    if count > 10:\n        break\n    b += 1\n\nb", "timeout": 30}) - MainThread
