2026-04-22 19:09:03,571[utu.hooks.base_hooks] - DEBUG - base_hooks.py:41 - [toolcall-chatcmpl-tool-bc96438838a7312c] execute_python_code({"code": "import math\n\ndef is_beautiful(n, b):\n    # Convert n to base b and check if it has exactly two digits\n    digits = []\n    while n > 0:\n        digits.append(n % b)\n        n //= b\n    if len(digits) == 2:\n        a, b = digits[0], digits[1]\n        # Check if the digits sum to sqrt(n)\n        return a + b == math.isqrt(a * b + b)\n    return False\n\ndef count_beautiful_numbers(b):\n    count = 0\n    # Optimized range: check up to b*2 since n must be close to a perfect square\n    for n in range(b, b*2):\n        if is_beautiful(n, b):\n            count += 1\n    return count\n\n# Find the smallest base b for which there are more than ten beautiful numbers\nb = 2\nwhile True:\n    if count_beautiful_numbers(b) > 10:\n        break\n    b += 1\n\nb", "timeout": 60}) - MainThread
2026-04-22 19:09:06,287[utu.hooks.base_hooks] - DEBUG - base_hooks.py:41 - [toolcall-chatcmpl-tool-b80a3f4bb9b80743] execute_python_code({"code": "import sympy as sp\n\n# Define the variable omega\nomega = sp.symbols('omega')\n\n# Define the expression\nexpression = sp.prod([2 - 2*omega**k + omega**(2*k) for k in range(13)])\n\n# Substitute omega with a primitive 13th root of unity\nprimitive_root = sp.exp(2 * sp.pi * sp.I / 13)\nexpression_substituted = expression.subs(omega, primitive_root)\n\n# Simplify the expression\nsimplified_expression = sp.simplify(expression_substituted)\n\n# Find the remainder when simplified_expression is divided by 1000\nremainder = simplified_expression % 1000\nremainder", "timeout": 30}) - MainThread
