2026-04-22 19:12:55,624[utu.hooks.base_hooks] - DEBUG - base_hooks.py:41 - [toolcall-chatcmpl-tool-a6300584c7a42a73] execute_python_code({"code": "import itertools\n\ndef find_possible_lists(sum_value, mode, min_value):\n    possible_lists = []\n    for i in range(1, sum_value):\n        for combination in itertools.combinations_with_replacement(range(min_value, sum_value), i):\n            if sum(combination) == sum_value and combination.count(mode) > combination.count(other) for other in combination:\n                possible_lists.append(combination)\n    return possible_lists"}) - MainThread
